  "content": "<h3>模组信息</h3>\n<p>此模组添加了由竹子制成的新建筑方块，每个方块还包括干燥纹理变体</p>\n<h4>模组包使用</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;欢迎您在本地使用本模组</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/677/335/java_2023-06-14_16-05-21.png\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/677/329/java_2023-06-14_15-45-13.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"141\"></p>\n<p>梯子</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/389/565/java_2021-08-21_16-45-52.png\" width=\"458\" height=\"138\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/389/568/java_2021-08-21_16-43-42.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"596\"></p>\n<p>栅栏</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/677/332/java_2023-06-14_15-45-38.png\" width=\"263\" height=\"142\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/677/331/java_2023-06-14_15-45-28.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"141\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/272/145/java_2019-07-23_00-54-28.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"596\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/677/336/java_2023-06-14_16-09-16.png\" width=\"444\" height=\"235\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/677/333/java_2023-06-14_15-45-47.png\" width=\"266\" height=\"140\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/677/330/java_2023-06-14_15-45-20.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"142\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/677/334/java_2023-06-14_15-45-54.png\" width=\"263\" height=\"140\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
